From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AURA Conversion Engine <aura@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] ASoC: codecs: lpass-va-macro: isolate register-name migration

Replace downstream LPASS_CDC_VA_* register references with the
upstream-local CDC_VA_* names where the register offsets are verified
to match exactly.  This is intended to be a mechanical-only migration
step before any lifecycle, runtime PM, SoundWire, or framework removal
changes.

The conversion intentionally does not guess replacements for registers
that are not present in the upstream VA macro register block; the
validation artifact records those as fail-closed.

Signed-off-by: AURA Conversion Engine <aura@example.invalid>
---
 validation: mapped register usages=24, unmapped register usages=4
 validation: offset mismatches=0
---
